WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.650
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:11.990
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:18.790
I'm Nijino Yume, a second-year exchange student at the idol middle school, Venus Ark.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.370
I work my hardest at Aikatsu every day!

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.920
Venus Ark came without warning.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:32.220
Rola, Mahiru-chan, and I ended up in a short-term exchange program to bolster our Aikatsu.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:37.720
We can't let up for a second if we want to be the greatest idols in the world.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.060
It's Hime-senpai's...

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:07.960
<i>She's even more incredible than I thought.</i>

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.710
Yes?

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.300
Yume-chan, are you free?

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.340
Koharu-chan! Come in.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:17.340
Were you designing your dress?

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:21.600
Yeah, I still don't have a Premium Rare Dress.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.060
I see.

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:27.600
It's going to be the most important dress in Berry Parfait's wardrobe.

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.980
I want to devote everything I have to it until I'm satisfied.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:38.360
As you should. Elza-sama was saying that a Premium Rare Dress is a muse in itself.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:40.280
In itself?

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:41.030
Right.

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:45.910
It's a very special dress stitched with your most precious feelings.

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:50.500
One look conveys the entire brand's concept.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.640
<i>My most precious feeling...</i>

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.390
<i>What is it?</i>

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.110
Okay, got it!

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:42.030
Let's go with a more energetic pose next.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.820
Yes, of course.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.080
Okay!

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.250
Yume-chan's so impressive.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:51.910
There you go, work it! Yes, exactly, more of that.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:53.080
She's improved to the point where she can respond to all the camerawoman's requests.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:05.090
Something's not right...

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.850
Nijino-san, it's time.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.100
Got it!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:14.190
Yume-chan, is it true that you're doing an exchange program?

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:18.520
Yes, I'm currently challenging myself to new Aikatsu at Venus Ark.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:21.360
Wow. What's it like there?

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:25.490
Great! I have so much fun learning new things every day.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.200
Good work today.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.960
Everyone, thanks for waiting.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:42.840
We'll be blocking the way here, so please line up to the side!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.510
Okay!

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:47.930
Would you like a hand?

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:50.140
Oh, thank you again.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.810
Here you are.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:52.640
Sure.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:56.810
Is everyone ready? Here we go!

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.900
Aikatsu!

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:07.490
<i>My fans must be looking forward to seeing this dress.</i>

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.030
<i>I can't disappoint them.</i>

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:13.330
<i>A wonderful dress that's all my own...</i>

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:24.760
Nijino-san, we've arrived.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:28.470
Okay! Thank you very much!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:37.730
This isn't good. I'm so busy, I have no time to ponder designs.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.240
Yume, holding up?

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:48.240
Having dinner now?

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.370
Later than I would've liked.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.410
That just shows how hard you're working.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.370
So, how's your design coming?

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:57.250
You know, it's like the more I think about it,

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.960
the more confused I make myself.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.630
Yume-chan...

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:07.720
It feels like my design is a fish swimming deep below the ocean's surface.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:13.010
I'm trying to fish it out with all my might, but it's just impossible.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.770
I guess I'm in a slump.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:20.650
Yume.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.770
The thing about slumps...

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:26.360
...is that only talented people get in them!

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:31.240
Maybe you should toss it all out and start from scratch.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.280
Yeah, that might work.

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:38.000
But I can't take any time off from work, and the deadline is almost here.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.670
That's true...

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.130
Oh, I have an idea!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:50.340
Nanakura Koharu Presents: Fishing Contest!

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:56.220
I asked the butler, and he took the boat out for us before work. {90% of the time I translate this as Sebastian when necessary}{I don't know what to feel}

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:59.190
I'm sorry for making you come out so early.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:04.980
Oh, don't be. I normally take the boat out to open waters to catch fresh fish.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.530
Your request was easy to fulfill.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.740
Thank you.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.950
Here's yours, Yume-chan.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:12.990
Thanks.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.490
I've never been fishing before.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:16.450
Me too!

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:17.950
Neither have I.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.580
Fishing is fun.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:23.500
Coming out early in the morning shouldn't affect your work.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:26.000
This is perfect for a change of pace.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.340
I get it now.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.800
Let's give it a whirl.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.760
All right, I'm gonna net a big one!

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:34.640
Huh?

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.640
Ah, good morning!

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:41.980
Kirara-chan!

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:44.900
It sounded like fun, so I hopped aboard!

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.860
Rei-chan's here too.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:49.150
This is very intriguing.

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:52.030
Aikatsu like this is nice every once in a while.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:53.410
Rei-san!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:56.160
Rei-chan got a bite!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.960
Rei-chan, you got it!

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.250
This gets me going!

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.090
Me too!

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:07.420
Let's do it!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:32.030
Well? Do you feel refreshed, Yume?

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:34.070
Yep, inside and out!

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.490
Yume-chan, was something wrong?

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.370
Yeah, just a little.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:42.250
I hit a wall with my dress design.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.420
So then...

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.880
So then?

00:08:55.630 --> 00:09:00.810
I figured I would clear my mind and listen right here.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.770
There... in your heart?

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.890
Yeah. The most important things

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:09.060
should be felt with the heart, not in the head.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:13.900
You're right. Seek not just lip service, but what truly excites you.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:17.620
Find it, and your dress will soon be complete.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:18.490
Right.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:21.580
My hat!

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:25.330
Wait!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:29.590
Koharu-chan!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.190
Koharu-chan, are you all right?

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:48.270
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:53.070
Thank goodness, and you even managed to save my hat. Thanks!

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:58.410
It appears she has injured her leg, 
so I will accompany her to the hospital.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:09:59.160
Huh?

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.780
I'm fine, it's really nothing...

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:02.790
No.

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:06.580
You mustn't underestimate the dangers of ocean wounds.

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.790
We will admit you for a full physical examination,

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.380
Koharu-sama.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:18.430
Berry Parfait's Premium Rare Dress release is fast approaching.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.800
We'll need the design ready by the end of this week.

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:22.930
Okay...

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:25.430
Now then, how is it going?

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:31.190
I'm sorry, but I still haven't figured out the most important part.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:35.440
Then allow me to say this as the brand's owner:

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:40.950
Your skills as a designer are, how should I put it... unripe.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.490
Yes...

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.120
But that's nothing to worry about.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.710
Everyone we have on staff is exceptional.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:51.710
So long as our muse puts her heart into the design and concept,

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:55.130
we can turn it into a wonderful dress.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.090
Yume-chan, we'll be ready for you.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.550
You can rely on us!

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:02.220
Let's make a lovely dress together.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.390
Everyone...

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:07.470
That means so much to me. I promise I'll make it in time!

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:10.230
Struggle for as long as you can.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:14.270
I'm certain this will be another step in your growth.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:15.770
Yes!

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:24.830
Here it is.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.000
Koharu-chan...

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:30.040
You're awake?

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:31.750
Yume-chan!

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:38.260
Yeah, the doctor said I could go back tomorrow.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.420
Really? I'm so relieved.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.180
Sorry for making you worry.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:45.930
And thanks for coming just to see me.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:49.560
I wanted to. Also, there's something I wanted to discuss.

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:50.680
About what?

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:55.940
My dress. You said you were formally studying design before.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:59.070
I was hoping you could give me some advice.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.990
It's Yume-chan!

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:05.950
Then the person in this room is... Koharu-chan!

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:10.700
Come on, now. You should know better than to peek into a girl's hospital room.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.750
What was that for?

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.670
Are you the real one?

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:24.340
That's right. Nice to meet you, I'm Nijino Yume.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.430
Wow, that's so cute!

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:31.600
Pretty!

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.310
What is it?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.600
This is a design for my dress.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:39.860
Yume-chan is thinking up a very special dress right now.

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.860
Hey, look at this.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:45.110
Ta-da! What do you think?

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.830
It's all frilly like a princess dress!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.000
Thanks!

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:54.750
Idols are so lucky they get to wear all sorts of stylish clothes.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:57.960
I'd love to wear an adorable dress like that too.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.130
Right?

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.500
Oh, would you?

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.260
Do you want to try these on then?

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.840
Whoa, they're so cute.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.680
Are those from Berry Parfait?

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:10.850
Yeah, I got a few samples at our meeting.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.850
Okay, everyone line up.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.570
There, a present for you.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.570
Adorable!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:24.990
I'm gonna find a mirror!

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.950
Thanks, Yume-chan!

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.200
Weren't they cute?

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.870
It's so much fun watching them enjoy themselves.

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:37.250
You were...

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:38.420
Come with me.

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:42.760
My sister's been hospitalized.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:45.840
Her name's Suzu. She's been feeling down.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:49.390
Um, those things before, the...

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:51.220
Oh, the hair accessories?

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.060
Yeah.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.600
For your little sister?

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:56.190
She's your fan.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.650
I'm sure it'd make her happy.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.070
Sure, no problem.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:07.530
Wait up!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.660
Wait for me!

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:14.580
Suzu-chan.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.750
Hello!

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:18.000
Mind if we come in?

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:21.840
Huh? Yume-chan and Koharu-chan!

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:22.670
Why are you here?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.800
I'm giving these out to everyone.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:29.380
If you're all right with it, can I put one on you?

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.260
Yeah!

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.350
It's so cute!

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:38.770
You look great with it.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:39.850
You really do!

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:42.060
Thanks, Yume-chan!

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:52.240
No, thank you. Seeing it make you so happy has made me glad too.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:54.160
Thanks again!

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:56.160
I'm just like Yume-chan!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.420
Suzu-chan, do you want to take a picture?

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:01.000
Yeah!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.880
Let's do it!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.880
I just remembered.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:13.850
That sparkling feeling I got when I first wore a dress as an idol.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:16.640
It felt like there was so much more I could be.

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:19.770
That I could shine from deep inside my heart!

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:21.270
Yeah.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.400
My most precious feelings.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:29.530
I want not just me, but everyone else to shine as brightly as they can.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:34.450
Berry Parfait is meant to bring out the best and brightest in everyone.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.410
That's just like you.

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:37.540
Really?

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:43.500
Why don't you run with that concept and try designing a dress from the ground up?{I know design is the hot new thing (I've even taken a design class) but we can be like this too}

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.300
Yeah, I'll do that.

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:49.670
Thanks, Koharu-chan. I'll get right to it.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:50.510
Bye!

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.890
Yume-chan, you can do it!

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:04.690
<i>It's done.</i>

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:08.730
<i>This is my Premium Rare Dress!</i>

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:32.090
<i>My first Premium Rare Dress, 
made with everyone at Berry Parfait.</i>

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.180
<i>The Première Berry Coord. {french premiere, apparently}</i>

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:39.310
<i>The liberal use of frills and layered skirts bring out the image of a parfait.</i>

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:44.480
<i>With strawberry pink coloring as an accent, it's a coord only I could make.</i>

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:48.610
<i>This dress will carry my feelings to everyone.</i>

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.860
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:07.560
Star Wings didn't appear... {materialize}

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.600
That means it didn't approve her for a Star Premium Rare Coord.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.520
Maybe the Aikatsu System is broken?

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.940
Yume-chan...

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.360
Girls!

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:18.570
Yume-chan!

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.360
Thanks for waiting!

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.360
Yume, great job.

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:23.610
Thanks!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:28.620
I'm so glad.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:29.540
Huh?

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:33.290
All of the audience left with big smiles.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:34.370
Yeah.

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:39.750
My feelings got across to them, and that made me happy.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:41.300
Yume.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:45.140
Even if I haven't reached the level of getting Star Wings yet,

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:49.260
I still feel like I've gained something important.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:53.520
I can't contain my excitement realizing that there's so much more I can do!

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:56.310
Yeah! That's the way to be, Yume.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:07.780
<i>I wonder if I'm any closer to Hime-senpai now.</i>

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:12.250
<i>She's definitely doing her Aikatsu somewhere out there.</i>

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.620
<i>I've gotta grow until I can reach her.</i>

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.420
Elza-san.

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:22.460
I saw your performance today.

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:28.430
Unfortunately, it seems you were unable to obtain a Star Premium Rare Coord.

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:29.470
Yes...

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:32.560
Please tell me.

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:35.560
What is it that I'm lacking?

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:38.310
A sense for design.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:42.940
Unless you are able to create a dress far surpassing what you have done before,

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:47.450
you will never be accepted as worthy of a Star Premium Rare Dress.

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:49.950
Right...

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:53.450
Behold this starry sky.

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:59.580
Only a handful of stars are able to outshine the rest.

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:05.670
Become the world's brightest star shining more brilliantly than all the rest.

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:08.840
Yume Nijino, in order to accomplish that,

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:12.970
you must obtain a Star Premium Rare Coord.

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:16.100
I believe you will be able to do so.

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:24.030
<i>A star... the world's brightest star!</i>

00:23:56.450 --> 00:24:01.750
I finally have my Premium Rare Dress, the Première Berry Coord!

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:05.210
All your worrying helped to make the ultimate Yume dress!

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:08.880
Thanks! I'm glad everyone else enjoyed it too.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:13.550
There is no place for weaklings in Venus Ark.

00:24:13.550 --> 00:24:16.050
Elza-san is always eating steak...

00:24:16.050 --> 00:24:17.600
